r the purpose of a gallery circuit or something similar. I used to feel quite cut about this but I think I’ve found other things to occupy myself. The art world and its creatures helped me learn about different things that have shaped how I conduct myself in a broader sense which has probably been the most productive thing. If anything, it actually taught me very little about art making lol.","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":null,"textStyle":"","textFormat":0}],"direction":null}}', 'Tell them I said no', NULL, 'A book I should have read years ago. ', '2025-10-28T09:00:00.000Z', 0, 'tell-them-i-said-no', '2025-10-28T10:35:27.014Z', '2025-10-28T09:55:08.009Z', 'published', '2025-10-28T10:35:27.816Z', '2025-10-28T10:35:27.816Z', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO "_posts_v" ("id", "parent_id", "version_title", "version_hero_image_id", "version_content", "version_meta_title", "version_meta_image_id", "version_meta_description", "version_published_at", "version_generate_slug", "version_slug", "version_updated_at", "version_created_at", "version__status", "created_at", "updated_at", "latest", "autosave") VALUES (61, 19, 'Tell them I said no', NULL, '{"root":{"type":"root","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"type":"block","fields":{"id":"6900933300f0998219e0d492","media":17,"blockName":"","blockType":"mediaBlock"},"format":"","version":2},{"type":"block","fields":{"id":"6903112d5eb6b167b541f6b7","style":"info","content":{"root":{"type":"root","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"Hello!","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":null,"textStyle":"","textFormat":0}],"direction":null}},"blockName":"","blockType":"banner"},"format":"","version":2},{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[],"direction":null,"textStyle":"","textFormat":0},{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"I am currently reading the book “Tell Them I Said No” by Martin Herbert, which is a collection of essays regarding different artists who have deliberately withdrawn from the art world (or, as I liked to think of it as ”the supermarket”). ","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":null,"textStyle":"","textFormat":0},{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"I’m only a fraction of the way through it but it is a beautiful read. I really wish that my younger self could have come across this book while still at art school and trying to reckon with “playing the game”, at least in New Zealand. ","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],