neration service similar to Speakeasy that also offered MCP server support. I saw that the ","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1},{"id":"6927c0795c552e06dcdd5b42","type":"link","fields":{"url":"https://github.com/sst/opencode-sdk-python","newTab":true,"linkType":"custom"},"format":"","indent":0,"version":3,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"SST team","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":null},{"mode":"normal","text":" and ","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1},{"id":"6927c0555c552e06dcdd5b41","type":"link","fields":{"url":"https://www.terminal.shop/api#client-sdks","linkType":"custom"},"format":"","indent":0,"version":3,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"terminal.shop","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":null},{"mode":"normal","text":" were already using this for their multi-language SDKs, so I tried pointing it to my API service.","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":null,"textStyle":"","textFormat":0},{"type":"paragraph","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"As a complete normie and noob when it comes to building out your own SDK, let alone an MCP server, this was genuinely such a painless and smooth experience. So far I haven''t actually needed to pay anything, and have SDKs for ","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1},{"id":"6927c0955c552e06dcdd5b43","type":"link","fields":{"url":"https://github.com/et0and/schools-sdk-typescript","newTab":true,"linkType":"custom"},"format":"","indent":0,"version":3,"children":[{"mode":"normal","text":"Typescript","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1}],"direction":null},{"mode":"normal","text":", ","type":"text","style":"","detail":0,"format":0,"version":1},{"id":"6927c0b65c552e06dcdd5b45","type":"link","fields":{"url":"https://github.com/et0and/schools-sdk-php","newTab":true,"linkType":"custom"},"